menu "APEX signed-read laboratory target"
config APEX_SIGNED_READ_LAB_OPT_IN
    bool "Enable USB-only signed reads using a separately provisioned lab key"
    default n
    help
        Owned or authorised laboratory equipment only. Enables experimental
        opcode 0x70 with info/capabilities/ping. No radio or legacy dispatch.
        This option does not authorise flashing, provisioning or device use.
endmenu
